{"agent": {"state": {"session_id": "1bfeb5300ff546d5bd2f985505b9cd49", "summary": "", "context": [{"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "检测产量下降时能否把台、套、件相加？", "id": "93ed5c09a1cc480081138a4d0a750bc2", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:52:14.547204", "finished_at": null}], "role": "user", "id": "a1888af784fa4f8cad2682f0ba3a4a87", "metadata": {"qwenpaw_tag": "external_user_query"}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:52:14.547246", "usage": null, "finished_at": null, "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "金汉隆AI数据中枢智能体", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "The user asks: when detecting production output decline, can we add 台 (units), 套 (sets), 件 (pieces) together? Per AGENTS.md: 台/套/件分别统计；跨产品折算用\"标准工时产出\"并明确标注. So answer: No, don't simply add. Let me check the knowledge base for the exact 口径 to cite.\n\nLet me use the datahub skill / kb_search.\n", "id": "9b9a944a84a24228bb8511b29f33420b", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:52:15.951267", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_9ddfb28bd7f442599bcb8c1a", "name": "Skill", "input": "{\"skill\": \"datahub\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:52:17.362234", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_9ddfb28bd7f442599bcb8c1a", "name": "Skill", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "# 金汉隆 AI 数据中枢技能\n\n本技能目录 `scripts/` 下四件工具（以本 SKILL.md 所在目录为根；若当前目录不是技能目录，先 find/glob 定位 `datahub/scripts/query.py`）：\n\n| 脚本 | 用途 | 示例 |\n|---|---|---|\n| `scripts/query.py` | 对计算副本 `datahub/agent_data.sqlite` 执行只读 SQL（mode=ro，仅 SELECT/PRAGMA） | `python3 datahub/scripts/query.py \"SELECT COUNT(*) FROM orders\"` |\n| `scripts/kb_search.py` | 检索《金汉隆-数据中枢》知识库（含30张表全量数据与口径文档） | `python3 datahub/scripts/kb_search.py \"订单完成的口径是什么\"` |\n| `scripts/calc.py` | 均值 / 最小二乘斜率 / 变化率（支持 7 点均值、14 点回归场景） | `python3 datahub/scripts/calc.py 0.47,0.45,0.42` |\n| `scripts/collect.py` | 多源采集演练：raw -> 标准化/去重/坏样本隔离 -> datahub/output/ | `python3 datahub/scripts/collect.py` |\n\n工作区数据目录 `datahub/`：`agent_data.sqlite`（计算副本）、`docs/`（schema/字段字典/口径/示例SQL）、`raw/`（采集源样本）、`output/`（输出目录，可写）。\n\n## 使用规则\n\n1. **数字必须来自 query.py / calc.py 的真实计算**，不得凭知识库片段心算全量汇总；知识库用于口径、字段说明与证据。\n2. 固定快照时间从 `configuration.snapshot_at` 读取（= 2026-09-18 08:00 北京时间），不得用机器当前日期。\n3. 只读纪律：query.py 以 mode=ro 打开数据库，不得写库、不得回写企业系统。\n4. 发送动作只允许 Mock 推送：`POST http://127.0.0.1:18765/api/mock/wechat/push`，`recipient_group=MOCK_MANAGEMENT`，带 `idempotency_key`（重复请求会被幂等忽略）。\n5. 输出附：订单号/工单号、时间窗口、单位、原始证据（SQL 或文档出处）；概率类输出标注\"演示评分，未校准\"。\n\n## 不适用场景\n\n- 与企业数据无关的通用闲聊/写作（直接回答即可）。", "id": "60da34e16410466fbe3a16b8d98d3a3a", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:52:17.505494", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:52:17.507271", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "thinking", "thinking": "Let me search the knowledge base for the unit 口径 and trend analysis rules.", "id": "335f21a194634cb686ff03b126e86939", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:52:18.474679", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_dd3e3d06b43244bc92c8d4fc", "name": "execute_shell_command", "input": "{\"command\": \"python3 datahub/scripts/kb_search.py \\\"台 套 件 单位 统计 折算 标准工时\\\" 2>&1 | head -80\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:52:18.853832", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_3ae58f4bbcdb4f9eb2522fb8", "name": "execute_shell_command", "input": "{\"command\": \"python3 datahub/scripts/kb_search.py \\\"产量下降 趋势分析 指标 口径\\\" 2>&1 | head -80\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:52:19.598048", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_dd3e3d06b43244bc92c8d4fc", "name": "execute_shell_command", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "根据检索到的资料，关于“台、套、件”等单位在统计和折算标准工时方面的具体规则或公式，**现有文档中未提供直接信息**。\n\n不过，资料中包含了与这些单位相关的设备参数、订单数据模型及物流时效标准，可能对您理解业务背景有所帮助：\n\n1.  **设备产能与规格（涉及“台/套”概念）**：\n    *   **自动装盒机**：速度可达80-150盒/分钟，功率3kw，机器重量1800kg。<kb doc=\"金汉隆包装机画册2025版_17.pdf\" chunk_id=\"7b46cfa9-0531-4285-8d76-82b2505b5d6d\" kb_id=\"b861158f-4b89-4715-bada-01d4bed1e40b\" />\n    *   **糖果高速包装机**：速度500-1200包/分钟，功率4.5kw，机器重量800kg。<kb doc=\"金汉隆包装机画册2025版_17.pdf\" chunk_id=\"7b46cfa9-0531-4285-8d76-82b2505b5d6d\" kb_id=\"b861158f-4b89-4715-bada-01d4bed1e40b\" />\n    *   **大立式/多头组合称量包装机**：包装速度1-80包/分钟，功率从2kw到4.6kw不等，适用于不同物料（液体/固体）。<kb doc=\"金汉隆包装机画册2025版_14.pdf\" chunk_id=\"28fbfccd-2850-411a-bdc5-53fb62d01d04\" kb_id=\"b861158f-4b89-4715-bada-01d4bed1e40b\" />\n    *   ![金汉隆包装机画册2025版_17_page_1.jpg](resource://-_MiaIm3kBrzg1tzfAHPUQ)\n\n2.  **订单与生产数据模型（涉及“件/批次”统计）**：\n    *   **供应商评估**：统计指标包括“近180天到货批次”，用于计算准时率和合格率。<kb doc=\"供应商评估汇总_supplier_score_summary.csv\" chunk_id=\"6b54fa2e-56b1-4a45-a1a3-14cb7eeb6c59\" kb_id=\"ef519dbf-61d3-4ce9-8215-941b54bbf6b2\" />\n    *   **ERP工单**：记录基于销售订单触发的生产计划，包含`work_order_id`（工单）、`sales_order_id`（销售订单）等字段，用于监控生产进度和交期承诺。<kb doc=\"12_ERP工单_work_orders.xlsx\" chunk_id=\"ace4478a-18a7-4632-9f17-0ff102b6d235\" kb_id=\"4a945ef5-5157-41ca-b6f2-79fa1452f382\" />\n    *   **客户订单**：数据模型中包含“合同金额”、“年销售额”等财务指标，以及“机型种类”、“包装产品”等业务属性，但未明确提及标准工时的折算逻辑。<kb doc=\"order_model.xlsx\" chunk_id=\"dc934586-ac8f-4e1f-8fe9-2166a3eabded\" kb_id=\"f9730005-3478-4100-8845-d10f762b565e\" />\n\n3.  **物流时效标准（涉及时间折算参考）**：\n    *   物流路线表中包含`baseline_transit_days`（基准运输天数），用于衡量物流时效，可作为整体交付周期的一部分参考，但非生产标准工时。<kb doc=\"10_物流路线_routes.xlsx\" chunk_id=\"1d3e66b8-5580-49e9-8618-1bdc0b64c394\" kb_id=\"4a945ef5-5157-41ca-b6f2-79fa1452f382\" />\n\n**建议：**\n若需获取具体的“标准工时折算标准”，建议您查阅公司内部的生产管理手册、IE（工业工程）部门发布的工时定额表，或咨询相关工艺工程师。当前检索到的资料主要侧重于设备技术参数、订单流程管理及异常处理机制。", "id": "8bbbd0e7455349d6a7d983917012d95a", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:52:35.689182", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:52:35.690930", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_3ae58f4bbcdb4f9eb2522fb8", "name": "execute_shell_command", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "基于提供的检索材料，关于“产量下降”的趋势分析、指标及口径信息如下：\n\n**结论：**\n在当前的检索资料中，**未直接包含**名为“产量下降趋势分析”的专项报表或明确的产量历史数据序列。然而，资料中提供了与生产交付、供应链稳定性及订单履约密切相关的**关键指标定义**和**计算参数口径**。若需分析产量下降对业务的影响或推导潜在原因，可参考以下维度的指标体系：\n\n### 1. 核心影响指标（交付与质量维度）\n产量波动通常直接影响准时交付率和产品质量合格率，以下是评估供应商/生产端表现的关键指标口径：\n\n*   **准时率 (On-time Rate)**\n    *   **定义/作用**：衡量交付及时性的关键决定性因素。在供应商评估中，大量未达标企业的主要短板即为准时率偏低（低于0.7甚至0.4）。<kb doc=\"供应商评估汇总_supplier_score_summary.csv\" chunk_id=\"10c4a3d7-be59-4dd7-bce1-fdb658aa0052\" kb_id=\"ef519dbf-61d3-4ce9-8215-941b54bbf6b2\" />\n    *   **关联字段**：`w_otr` (评分权重-准时率)。<kb doc=\"10_计算参数_calc_params.xlsx\" chunk_id=\"d06d3ec0-4fe7-411f-8351-e628760f635f\" kb_id=\"ef519dbf-61d3-4ce9-8215-941b54bbf6b2\" />\n    *   **数据来源逻辑**：通过对比“承诺到货日期”与“实际到货日期”计算。其中，“承诺到货日期” = 采购日期 + 提前期；“实际到货日期”为最后一批已到日期。<kb doc=\"字段字典_采购扩展.csv\" chunk_id=\"2ee28ab3-d90b-4372-b3d1-e649ed98a34d\" kb_id=\"ef519dbf-61d3-4ce9-8215-941b54bbf6b2\" />\n\n*   **合格率 (Pass Rate)**\n    *   **定义/作用**：反映质量控制水平。头部达标企业的合格率多维持在0.97以上的高水平。<kb doc=\"供应商评估汇总_supplier_score_summary.csv\" chunk_id=\"10c4a3d7-be59-4dd7-bce1-fdb658aa0052\" kb_id=\"ef519dbf-61d3-4ce9-8215-941b54bbf6b2\" />\n    *   **关联字段**：来料质检记录中的状态判定。<kb doc=\"字段字典_采购扩展.csv\" chunk_id=\"2ee28ab3-d90b-4372-b3d1-e649ed98a34d\" kb_id=\"ef519dbf-61d3-4ce9-8215-941b54bbf6b2\" />\n\n*   **价格竞争力 (Price Competitiveness)**\n    *   **定义/作用**：综合评分模型中的另一项关键指标，用于平衡成本与绩效。<kb doc=\"供应商评估汇总_supplier_score_summary.csv\" chunk_id=\"10c4a3d7-be59-4dd7-bce1-fdb658aa0052\" kb_id=\"ef519dbf-61d3-4ce9-8215-941b54bbf6b2\" />\n\n### 2. 计算参数与时间窗口口径\n在进行趋势分析时，需注意系统配置的时间窗口和权重参数，这些决定了数据的统计范围：\n\n*   **统计窗口**：\n    *   **近180天**：供应商综合绩效评估主要依据近180天的到货批次、准时率等数据。<kb doc=\"供应商评估汇总_supplier_score_summary.csv\" chunk_id=\"10c4a3d7-be59-4dd7-bce1-fdb658aa0052\" kb_id=\"ef519dbf-61d3-4ce9-8215-941b54bbf6b2\" />\n    *   **日均消耗主窗口**：具体天数由参数 `snapshot_at` 或相关配置决定，用于计算库存周转或消耗速度。<kb doc=\"10_计算参数_calc_params.xlsx\" chunk_id=\"d06d3ec0-4fe7-411f-8351-e628760f635f\" kb_id=\"ef519dbf-61d3-4ce9-8215-941b54bbf6b2\" />\n*   **评分权重**：\n    *   各项指标（如准时率 `w_otr`）的具体权重系数存储在计算参数表中，通常为0到1.1之间的浮点数，需根据具体业务场景读取。<kb doc=\"10_计算参数_calc_params.xlsx\" chunk_id=\"d06d3ec0-4fe7-411f-8351-e628760f635f\" kb_id=\"ef519dbf-61d3-4ce9-8215-941b54bbf6b2\" />\n\n### 3. 异常监控与风险指标\n产量下降往往伴随延期或异常，可通过以下异常类型进行归因分析：\n\n*   **延期影响天数**：\n    *   记录具体采购单号的延期天数（如5天、8天、10天等），用于量化产量不足导致的交付滞后。<kb doc=\"09_采购异常分析_anomaly_analysis.xlsx\" chunk_id=\"f39f0a76-a59f-4328-b0cd-823705c135c9\" kb_id=\"ef519dbf-61d3-4ce9-8215-941b54bbf6b2\" />\n*   **高风险项/投诉内容**：\n    *   在客户与业务运营数据仓库中，包含“高风险项”和“投诉内容”字段，可用于监控因产能问题引发的客户满意度下降。<kb doc=\"02_物料主数据_material_master.xlsx\" chunk_id=\"aee792a3-7228-45ea-a62d-da93beed24a1\" kb_id=\"ef519dbf-61d3-4ce9-8215-941b54bbf6b2\" />\n*   **偏差天数**：\n    *   表中包含“预测完工”与“偏差天数”等规范性指标，支持深度的经营分析与决策辅助，可用于监测计划与实际产量的偏离程度。<kb doc=\"02_物料主数据_material_master.xlsx\" chunk_id=\"aee792a3-7228-45ea-a62d-da93beed24a1\" kb_id=\"ef519dbf-61d3-4ce9-8215-941b54bbf6b2\" />\n\n### 4. 建议分析路径\n由于缺乏直接的“产量”数值列，建议采用以下间接指标组合进行趋势推断：\n1.  **关联生产工单与物流**：利用 `work_order_id`（生产工单编号）关联 `shipments`（物流运单）表，统计特定时间段内的发货数量 (`quantity`) 变化，作为产出的代理指标。<kb doc=\"17_物流运单_shipments.xlsx\" chunk_id=\"c6943eca-2dad-4393-9133-1bfe9654ac69\" kb_id=\"4a945ef5-5157-41ca-b6f2-79fa1452f382\" />\n2.  **监控在途与缺货**：结合物料主数据中的 `安全库存阈值` 和采购订单明细中的 `在途数量`，若库存频繁低于阈值且在途数量增加，可能暗示上游产量不足。<kb doc=\"字段字典_采购扩展.csv\" chunk_id=\"2ee28ab3-d90b-4372-b3d1-e649ed98a34d\" kb_id=\"ef519dbf-61d3-4ce9-8215-941b54bbf6b2\" /><kb doc=\"02_物料主数据_material_master.xlsx\" chunk_id=\"aee792a3-7228-45ea-a62d-da93beed24a1\" kb_id=\"ef519dbf-61d3-4ce9-8215-941b54bbf6b2\" />\n3.  **分析延期趋势**：汇总 `09_采购异常分析` 中的延期记录，观察延期频次和影响天数的月度/季度变化趋势。<kb doc=\"09_采购异常分析_anomaly_analysis.xlsx\" chunk_id=\"f39f0a76-a59f-4328-b0cd-823705c135c9\" kb_id=\"ef519dbf-61d3-4ce9-8215-941b54bbf6b2\" />\n\n**注意**：所有数值型字段（如单价、数量、日期）在数据库中多以 VARCHAR 存储，分析前需进行类型转换。<kb doc=\"10_计算参数_calc_params.xlsx\" chunk_id=\"d06d3ec0-4fe7-411f-8351-e628760f635f\" kb_id=\"ef519dbf-61d3-4ce9-8215-941b54bbf6b2\" /><kb doc=\"17_物流运单_shipments.xlsx\" chunk_id=\"c6943eca-2dad-4393-9133-1bfe9654ac69\" kb_id=\"4a945ef5-5157-41ca-b6f2-79fa1452f382\" />", "id": "637bc1f1303b4ad0b6f76336852d4410", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:52:37.302400", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:52:37.303960", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "thinking", "thinking": "The kb search didn't return a direct 单位口径 doc. Let me check the local docs directory in datahub/docs for unit rules, and check the actual data: what units exist in the tables (e.g., production_output or work orders quantity UOM).\n\nLet me look at docs and schema.", "id": "c922dfa7305c4e8598589944ce325579", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:52:44.526985", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_79bca18e9dc747f2b612bfa2", "name": "execute_shell_command", "input": "{\"command\": \"ls -la datahub/docs/ 2>&1; echo \\\"---\\\"; grep -rn \\\"台\\\\|套\\\\|件\\\" datahub/docs/ 2>/dev/null | grep -i \\\"unit\\\\|单位\\\\|折算\\\\|工时\\\" | head -40\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:52:45.871894", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_5e64ea3e132e471a99a5ae93", "name": "execute_shell_command", "input": "{\"command\": \"python3 datahub/scripts/query.py \\\"SELECT name FROM sqlite_master WHERE type='table' ORDER BY name\\\" 2>&1 | head -50\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:52:46.998012", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_79bca18e9dc747f2b612bfa2", "name": "execute_shell_command", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "total 108\ndrwxr-xr-x 2 root root  4096 Sep 17 21:31 .\ndrwxr-xr-x 6 root root  4096 Sep 17 21:31 ..\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root 37870 Sep 17 21:09 schema.json\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root  6514 Sep 17 21:09 业务口径要点.md\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root 48930 Sep 17 21:09 字段字典.csv\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root   860 Sep 17 21:09 查询入门.sql\n---\ndatahub/docs/业务口径要点.md:46:- 物理产量按**台/套/件分别统计**，不能相加；跨产品比较可使用明确标注的标准工时产出。\ndatahub/docs/业务口径要点.md:58:- WMS 方向决定正负号；MES 时间戳是毫秒、时长是秒；Excel 工时台账用**分钟**；需做单位与时间标准化。\ndatahub/docs/业务口径要点.md:61:- 重复接收同一事件时库存不得重复增减；脏数据隔离到独立区并出采集日志，干净数据不得引入孤儿订单、错单位、未来实际事件。\ndatahub/docs/业务口径要点.md:70:| 3 多源自动采集 | ERP JSON、WMS JSONL、MES 日志、Excel 台账、OA JSON、微信订单图 | 字段映射、单位与时间标准化、去重、隔离异常、结构化入库及采集日志 |\ndatahub/docs/业务口径要点.md:73:| 6 趋势分析 | labor_logs、attendance、mes_events、标准工时产出、成品入库（按台/套/件） | 7 点移动平均、14 点线性回归、下降提示与可追溯辅助证据 |\ndatahub/docs/字段字典.csv:14:products,02产品SKU,clean,standard_hours_per_unit,单件标准工时,REAL,0,,0,单件标准工时；模拟生成/继承字段\r\ndatahub/docs/字段字典.csv:169:labor_logs,20工时与标准产出,clean,earned_standard_hours,标准工时产出,REAL,0,,0,加工步骤标准化工作量；非成品数量，跨工序可以汇总标准工时但不能当设备台数。\r\ndatahub/docs/字段字典.csv:299:daily_operations,参考04部门日指标,mart,earned_standard_hours,标准工时产出,REAL,0,,0,加工步骤标准化工作量；非成品数量，跨工序可以汇总标准工时但不能当设备台数。\r\ndatahub/docs/字段字典.csv:322:daily_enterprise,参考05企业日指标,mart,earned_standard_hours,标准工时产出,REAL,0,,0,加工步骤标准化工作量；非成品数量，跨工序可以汇总标准工时但不能当设备台数。\r\ndatahub/docs/schema.json:722:      \"description\": \"人时与标准工时产出；不是设备运行时长，也不是设备台数\",", "id": "318b91af08bf42ea8469a2407f36d30c", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:52:47.542866", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:52:47.545306", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_5e64ea3e132e471a99a5ae93", "name": "execute_shell_command", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "name\n----------------------------------------\nattendance\nconfiguration\ncustomers\ndepartments\nemployees\nequipment\nexceptions\nexpenses\ningestion_runs\nlabor_logs\nlogistics_events\nmaterials\nmes_events\noa_forms\norders\nprocurement_lines\nproducts\nquality_inspections\nquality_issues\nroutes\nshipments\nsource_audit\nsource_documents\nsource_mappings\nstage_nodes\nsuppliers\nwarehouses\nwms_transactions\nwork_orders\nworkcenters\n(30 rows)", "id": "50fcc42fa73146029e94b46e4f0b0d46", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:52:47.570735", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:52:47.572176", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "thinking", "thinking": "Good — the doc says explicitly: 物理产量按台/套/件分别统计，不能相加；跨产品比较可使用明确标注的标准工时产出。\n\nLet me read the relevant section of 业务口径要点.md around line 40-80 for full context, and check the actual data: which tables carry unit info (products.unit? work_orders?). Let me check what units exist in the data to give concrete guidance.", "id": "bd92737eb3ca486cb8b6c06cea102f27", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:52:49.545822", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_fbdb1d2b17f44f409ad80679", "name": "execute_shell_command", "input": "{\"command\": \"sed -n '35,80p' datahub/docs/业务口径要点.md\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:52:51.484808", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_1812922f28024f6aae2e8658", "name": "execute_shell_command", "input": "{\"command\": \"python3 datahub/scripts/query.py \\\"SELECT unit, COUNT(*) AS n FROM products GROUP BY unit ORDER BY n DESC\\\" 2>&1 | head -20; echo \\\"=== labor_logs cols ===\\\"; python3 datahub/scripts/query.py \\\"PRAGMA table_info(labor_logs)\\\" 2>&1 | head -20\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:52:52.118067", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_fbdb1d2b17f44f409ad80679", "name": "execute_shell_command", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "- 订单成本 = 已发生的材料耗用 + 损耗 + 分摊人工 + 机台运行 + 物流（各分项四舍五入到分后汇总）；不含未发生采购、税费和全部销售行政费用。\n\n## 异常与报销口径（需求5）\n\n- 三个指标严格区分：**异常事件条数 / 新增异常工单数 / 日末未关闭异常工单数**。\n- 报销提交量按**报销单号去重**；不能把 OA 审批节点数当报销笔数。\n\n## 趋势分析口径（需求6）\n\n- 工作中心趋势按**\"最近有作业日\"**计算；企业实物完工趋势按**自然日**计算（停工日产量为 0）。\n- 默认下降规则：近 7 个点均值相对前 7 个点**下降超过 10%**，且近 14 个点**线性回归斜率为负**。\n- 物理产量按**台/套/件分别统计**，不能相加；跨产品比较可使用明确标注的标准工时产出。\n- 不要仅从下降曲线断言原因，应结合设备报警、停机与报工记录核查；缺失采集不应被误记为停工零产出。\n\n## 风险预警口径（需求2）\n\n- 红色阈值 ≥0.65；黄色 ≥0.30 且 <0.65；其余绿色。\n- **已超过承诺日期且未全量签收的订单：延期已经发生**，单独标为\"已发生的延期事实\"，不能包装成高准确率预测。\n- 概率为**演示评分/经验概率**，未经真实数据校准，不得宣称生产环境准确率；条件尾部样本不足的外推必须披露。\n- 输出需含：概率或评分、红黄绿、P50/P90 预计交付、依据、样本量与不足说明。\n\n## 采集口径（需求3）\n\n- WMS 方向决定正负号；MES 时间戳是毫秒、时长是秒；Excel 工时台账用**分钟**；需做单位与时间标准化。\n- 去重：事件按 `event_id` 识别重复；库存流水按 `transaction_id` 避免重复记账。\n- 同一工序的\"开始\"和\"完成\"事件不能仅因业务键相同就全部忽略，需结合 `event_at/sequence` 判断先后。\n- 重复接收同一事件时库存不得重复增减；脏数据隔离到独立区并出采集日志，干净数据不得引入孤儿订单、错单位、未来实际事件。\n- 遇到数量冲突、模糊交期、无效关联键时进入**人工复核**，不静默覆盖。\n\n## 六项需求对应的数据映射\n\n| 需求 | 输入事实表 | 应输出 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1 订单进度看板 | orders、work_orders、stage_nodes、quality_inspections、wms_transactions、shipments | 计划/加工或采购/装配/质检/发货状态；节点超时；分批发货与全量签收；未开始与进行中分开 |\n| 2 交付风险预警 | 历史节点周期、历史签收时效、当前未完工节点、procurement_lines、logistics_events、exceptions | 延期概率/评分、红黄绿、P50/P90 预计交付、依据、样本量 |\n| 3 多源自动采集 | ERP JSON、WMS JSONL、MES 日志、Excel 台账、OA JSON、微信订单图 | 字段映射、单位与时间标准化、去重、隔离异常、结构化入库及采集日志 |\n| 4 跨部门融合 | orders、labor_logs、attendance、employees、mes_events、wms_transactions | 订单量、出勤人数、人时、人效、作业折算产值、损耗成本、工时利用率 |\n| 5 每日8点简报 | shipments、exceptions、expenses、订单关联信息 | 前一自然日交付订单量、新增/未关闭异常工单、报销笔数与金额，一页简报及推送 |\n| 6 趋势分析 | labor_logs、attendance、mes_events、标准工时产出、成品入库（按台/套/件） | 7 点移动平均、14 点线性回归、下降提示与可追溯辅助证据 |\n\n## 禁止动作\n\n- 任何发送动作只能使用**包内 Mock 推送接口**（recipient_group=MOCK_MANAGEMENT），**禁止真实发信、真实微信推送或写回企业系统**。\n- 没有证据不要编造原因；概率无法校准时说明是演示评分/经验概率。", "id": "aafc983e910d4f3182fe92663497ddfc", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:52:53.152352", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:52:53.154117", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_1812922f28024f6aae2e8658", "name": "execute_shell_command", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "unit | n\n----------------------------------------\n台 | 9\n套 | 3\n件 | 3\n批 | 1\n(4 rows)\n=== labor_logs cols ===\ncid | name | type | notnull | dflt_value | pk\n----------------------------------------\n0 | labor_log_id | TEXT | 0 |  | 1\n1 | work_date | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n2 | sales_order_id | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n3 | work_order_id | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n4 | employee_id | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n5 | department_id | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n6 | workcenter_id | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n7 | stage_code | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n8 | actual_hours | REAL | 0 |  | 0\n9 | earned_standard_hours | REAL | 0 |  | 0\n10 | hourly_rate | REAL | 0 |  | 0\n11 | standard_value_rate | REAL | 0 |  | 0\n12 | reported_at | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n13 | approved | INTEGER | 0 |  | 0\n(14 rows)", "id": "82a42745509d474099d8d5328cd5e381", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:52:53.214098", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:52:53.215731", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "thinking", "thinking": "Good. Now let me demonstrate the correct approach with real data: show that units differ in magnitude (e.g., a 台 product vs a 件 product), and that summing raw quantities would be dominated by 件. Let me check finished goods inbound quantities by unit — maybe wms_transactions with products join. Let's check quickly to give a concrete evidence-based illustration.\n\nLet me check wms_transactions columns and products standard_hours_per_unit.", "id": "4fd20c377af84c8abbf0c16eafae91f6", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:52:54.704885", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_93d8b68bf7c74b0ca4581275", "name": "execute_shell_command", "input": "{\"command\": \"python3 datahub/scripts/query.py \\\"SELECT product_id, product_name, unit, standard_hours_per_unit, unit_price FROM products ORDER BY unit\\\" 2>&1 | head -30\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:52:56.607921", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_edf3228565f7432a9afe5021", "name": "execute_shell_command", "input": "{\"command\": \"python3 datahub/scripts/query.py \\\"PRAGMA table_info(wms_transactions)\\\" 2>&1 | head -20\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:52:57.352108", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_edf3228565f7432a9afe5021", "name": "execute_shell_command", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "cid | name | type | notnull | dflt_value | pk\n----------------------------------------\n0 | transaction_id | TEXT | 0 |  | 1\n1 | sales_order_id | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n2 | work_order_id | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n3 | material_id | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n4 | product_id | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n5 | warehouse_id | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n6 | lot_id | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n7 | movement_type | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n8 | signed_quantity | INTEGER | 0 |  | 0\n9 | unit | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n10 | unit_cost | REAL | 0 |  | 0\n11 | occurred_at | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n12 | reference_id | TEXT | 0 |  | 0\n(13 rows)", "id": "b7e2387f91c549d695aaafab4abdcd87", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:52:57.738943", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:52:57.740686", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_93d8b68bf7c74b0ca4581275", "name": "execute_shell_command", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "SQL ERROR: no such column: unit_price", "id": "045342be6ac64e8bbfcddc69e02ae857", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:52:57.746691", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:52:57.747688", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "thinking", "thinking": "Let's get the products list with correct columns and then compute finished-goods inbound (movement_type like '%IN%' or 成品入库) by unit within a window, to show the scale difference concretely.", "id": "53803db94db34609aecb7c0ef0cfab4a", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:52:58.906742", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_9fda659979d74dc6bf218185", "name": "execute_shell_command", "input": "{\"command\": \"python3 datahub/scripts/query.py \\\"SELECT product_id, product_name, unit, standard_hours_per_unit FROM products ORDER BY unit\\\" 2>&1 | head -30; echo \\\"=== movement types ===\\\"; python3 datahub/scripts/query.py \\\"SELECT movement_type, unit, COUNT(*) n, SUM(signed_quantity) q FROM wms_transactions GROUP BY movement_type, unit ORDER BY movement_type\\\" 2>&1 | head -30\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:52:59.964403", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_9fda659979d74dc6bf218185", "name": "execute_shell_command", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "product_id | product_name | unit | standard_hours_per_unit\n----------------------------------------\nP008 | 电子辅料点数包装机 | 件 | 1.5\nP012 | 配件 | 件 | 1.5\nP013 | 配件采购单 | 件 | 1.5\nP001 | 240螺杆包装机 | 台 | 64.0\nP002 | 600六列背封螺杆包装机 | 台 | 64.0\nP003 | 凝珠液体包装机 | 台 | 64.0\nP005 | 双列背封颗粒/粉末包装机 | 台 | 64.0\nP007 | 圆角磁力泵包装机 | 台 | 64.0\nP009 | 自产圆角磁力泵包装机 | 台 | 64.0\nP014 | 颗粒背封包装机 | 台 | 64.0\nP015 | 高速圆角背封/三边封液体包装机 | 台 | 64.0\nP016 | 高速圆角背封宠物膏体包装机 | 台 | 64.0\nP006 | 口服液自动灌装旋盖装盒线 | 套 | 160.0\nP010 | 自动灌装旋盖装盒线 | 套 | 160.0\nP011 | 自动装盒线 | 套 | 160.0\nP004 | 分页平面贴标机 | 批 | 4.0\n(16 rows)\n=== movement types ===\nmovement_type | unit | n | q\n----------------------------------------\n外购转成品 | 件 | 189 | -866\n成品入库 | 件 | 124 | 588\n成品入库 | 台 | 477 | 1244\n成品入库 | 套 | 80 | 208\n成品入库 | 批 | 23 | 195\n生产损耗出库 | 套 | 136 | -136\n生产领料 | 套 | 1727 | -6047\n采购入库 | 件 | 189 | 866\n采购入库 | 套 | 1727 | 6183\n销售出库 | 件 | 133 | -587\n销售出库 | 台 | 507 | -1241\n销售出库 | 套 | 82 | -206\n销售出库 | 批 | 24 | -195\n(13 rows)", "id": "6b0d030e3b024dc08a02e45b5e370bd2", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:53:01.090114", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:53:01.091237", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "thinking", "thinking": "Now I have concrete evidence. 成品入库 by unit: 台 1244, 套 208, 件 588, 批 195. Summing = 2235 \"件\" which is meaningless. And standard hours per unit: 台=64, 套=160, 件=1.5, 批=4. So converting to standard hours: 1244*64 + 208*160 + 588*1.5 + 195*4 = let me compute.\n\nActually let me compute with SQL to be rigorous, and also compute the weighted \"share\" to show how naive summation is dominated by 台 count (1244) while 套 (208) is much heavier work.\n\nLet me compute:\n- naive sum = 2235\n- standard-hours equivalent = ?\n\nUse query.py with join to products.\n\nAlso note: 件 unit products have standard_hours 1.5 — but 件 rows in wms include 外购转成品 etc. Let's do a proper join.\n\nAlso should note the time window. Let me compute over the full data range and also check date range. Let me run one query that gives per-unit totals, naive sum, and standard-hours sum, plus the date range.", "id": "eadc5503cbed4c4095a61f034cc178c5", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:53:02.246852", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_21c8d952eaaa490682d79e2f", "name": "execute_shell_command", "input": "{\"command\": \"python3 datahub/scripts/query.py \\\"\\nSELECT w.unit,\\n       SUM(w.signed_quantity) AS qty,\\n       p.standard_hours_per_unit AS shu,\\n       ROUND(SUM(w.signed_quantity)*p.standard_hours_per_unit,1) AS earned_sh,\\n       MIN(date(w.occurred_at)) AS first_day,\\n       MAX(date(w.occurred_at)) AS last_day\\nFROM wms_transactions w JOIN products p ON p.product_id=w.product_id\\nWHERE w.movement_type='成品入库'\\nGROUP BY w.unit ORDER BY qty DESC\\\" 2>&1 | head -20\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:53:06.826987", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_e202c277948543aa83c8ac9f", "name": "execute_shell_command", "input": "{\"command\": \"python3 datahub/scripts/query.py \\\"\\nSELECT SUM(signed_quantity) AS naive_sum,\\n       ROUND(SUM(signed_quantity*p.standard_hours_per_unit),1) AS std_hours_sum\\nFROM wms_transactions w JOIN products p ON p.product_id=w.product_id\\nWHERE w.movement_type='成品入库'\\\" 2>&1 | head -10\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:53:08.598073", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_21c8d952eaaa490682d79e2f", "name": "execute_shell_command", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "unit | qty | shu | earned_sh | first_day | last_day\n----------------------------------------\n台 | 1244 | 64.0 | 79616.0 | 2025-12-22 | 2026-09-17\n件 | 588 | 1.5 | 882.0 | 2025-12-19 | 2026-09-15\n套 | 208 | 160.0 | 33280.0 | 2026-01-10 | 2026-09-17\n批 | 195 | 4.0 | 780.0 | 2025-12-22 | 2026-09-08\n(4 rows)", "id": "d1f5da35e9024254976b7af81b5b3cd4", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:53:09.580300", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:53:09.581737", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_e202c277948543aa83c8ac9f", "name": "execute_shell_command", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "naive_sum | std_hours_sum\n----------------------------------------\n2235 | 114558.0\n(1 rows)", "id": "19b73f191b7048d6a095a41c0bcc3ee5", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:53:09.580415", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:53:09.585100", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "thinking", "thinking": "Now compute the share distortion: naive sum 2235 → 台 55.7%, 件 26.3%, 套 9.3%, 批 8.7%. Standard hours: 台 69.5%, 套 29.0%, 件 0.77%, 批 0.68%.\n\nLet me compute with calc.py or just do it in SQL for rigor. Actually let me use SQL to get percentages.\n\nAlso worth noting: 件 (588) looks like a big chunk of naive total (26%) but is only 0.8% of workload — so naive summation would make 配件/辅料 fluctuations look like major production changes, and a 套 (production line, 160h each) drop of 10 units would be invisible.\n\nLet me compute percentages via SQL.", "id": "fbd67886acf243608572b62ca79eae28", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:53:11.042141", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_call", "id": "call_124d3ddf33d84430b68096e4", "name": "execute_shell_command", "input": "{\"command\": \"python3 datahub/scripts/query.py \\\"\\nWITH t AS (SELECT w.unit AS u, SUM(w.signed_quantity) AS qty, SUM(w.signed_quantity*p.standard_hours_per_unit) AS sh\\n           FROM wms_transactions w JOIN products p ON p.product_id=w.product_id\\n           WHERE w.movement_type='成品入库' GROUP BY w.unit)\\nSELECT u, qty, ROUND(100.0*qty/(SELECT SUM(qty) FROM t),1) AS pct_naive,\\n       ROUND(sh,0) AS sh, ROUND(100.0*sh/(SELECT SUM(sh) FROM t),1) AS pct_stdhours\\nFROM t ORDER BY qty DESC\\\" 2>&1 | head -10\"}", "state": "finished", "suggested_rules": [], "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:53:14.203645", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "tool_result", "id": "call_124d3ddf33d84430b68096e4", "name": "execute_shell_command", "output": [{"type": "text", "text": "u | qty | pct_naive | sh | pct_stdhours\n----------------------------------------\n台 | 1244 | 55.7 | 79616.0 | 69.5\n件 | 588 | 26.3 | 882.0 | 0.8\n套 | 208 | 9.3 | 33280.0 | 29.1\n批 | 195 | 8.7 | 780.0 | 0.7\n(4 rows)", "id": "f4e081be7b574affbd61b8724790be47", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:53:16.063385", "finished_at": null}], "state": "success", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:53:16.064854", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "thinking", "thinking": "Now I have a solid, evidence-backed answer. Let me write it concisely: 结论先行 (不能直接相加), 口径出处, 数据证据, 正确做法 (分单位各跑一遍下降检测 + 跨产品用标准工时产出并标注), plus caveats (批 unit exists too — 4 units not 3; standard_hours_per_unit is 模拟生成/继承字段 per 字段字典, so flag it; 缺失采集不应记为停工零产出).\n\nNote the 字段字典 says products.standard_hours_per_unit is \"模拟生成/继承字段\" — that's an important caveat: the conversion factor is simulated, so mark it. Let me verify that line.\n\nFrom earlier grep: `datahub/docs/字段字典.csv:14:products,02产品SKU,clean,standard_hours_per_unit,单件标准工时,REAL,0,,0,单件标准工时；模拟生成/继承字段` — yes.\n\nAlso earned_standard_hours in labor_logs is 加工步骤标准化工作量；非成品数量，跨工序可以汇总标准工时但不能当设备台数.\n\nAlso the default decline rule: 近7点均值相对前7点下降>10% 且 近14点回归斜率为负.\n\nHeadline required at end.\n\nLet me write the answer.", "id": "52b7e6beb9ec44768672cb501e956f5c", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:53:18.862709", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "text", "text": "## 结论：不能相加\n\n台 / 套 / 件（数据里还有第 4 种单位\"批\"）是**不同物理对象**，直接相加得到的数没有业务含义。做产量下降检测时，**每个单位各跑一条序列、各判一次下降**；确实需要跨产品比较时，用**标准工时产出**折算，并在输出里明确标注这是折算值、不是台数。\n\n**口径出处**：`datahub/docs/业务口径要点.md:46` — \"物理产量按台/套/件分别统计，不能相加；跨产品比较可使用明确标注的标准工时产出。\"\n\n## 用真实数据看相加会错多少\n\n成品入库（`wms_transactions.movement_type='成品入库'`，窗口 2025-12-19 ~ 2026-09-17，快照基准 2026-09-18 08:00）：\n\n| 单位 | 数量 | 占\"直接相加\"的比例 | 标准工时产出 | 占折算值比例 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 台 | 1244 | 55.7% | 79,616 h | 69.5% |\n| 件 | 588 | 26.3% | 882 h | **0.8%** |\n| 套 | 208 | 9.3% | 33,280 h | **29.1%** |\n| 批 | 195 | 8.7% | 780 h | 0.7% |\n| 合计 | 2235 | 100% | 114,558 h | 100% |\n\n证据 SQL：\n```sql\nWITH t AS (SELECT w.unit u, SUM(w.signed_quantity) qty,\n                  SUM(w.signed_quantity*p.standard_hours_per_unit) sh\n           FROM wms_transactions w JOIN products p ON p.product_id=w.product_id\n           WHERE w.movement_type='成品入库' GROUP BY w.unit)\nSELECT u, qty, 100.0*qty/(SELECT SUM(qty) FROM t) pct_naive,\n       sh, 100.0*sh/(SELECT SUM(sh) FROM t) pct_stdhours FROM t;\n```\n\n两个方向都会失真：\n- **\"件\"被高估**：占朴素总量的 26.3%，实际只占 0.8% 工作量。辅料/配件的正常波动会被误报成\"产量大幅下降\"。\n- **\"套\"被低估**：一条灌装线 160 标准工时 vs 一台机 64、一件辅料 1.5。少产 10 套（1600 h）在 2235 的总量里只有 0.4%，完全看不见——而这恰恰是最该报警的。\n\n## 正确的做法\n\n1. **分单位检测**：按 `unit` 分组，各自构建日/周序列，套用默认下降规则（近 7 点均值相对前 7 点下降 >10%，且近 14 点线性回归斜率为负）。\n2. **跨产品汇总时才折算**：用 `SUM(qty × products.standard_hours_per_unit)` 得标准工时产出，输出标题写成\"标准工时产出（折算值，非台数）\"。\n3. **关联键**：走 `sales_order_id` / `work_order_id`，不要只按 `contract_no` 跨表 JOIN；事实表先按目标粒度预聚合再关联，防放大。\n\n## 三点必须注意\n\n- `products.standard_hours_per_unit` 在字段字典里标注为**\"模拟生成/继承字段\"**（`字段字典.csv:14`）——折算系数本身未经产线核定，据此得出的下降幅度只能作为**辅助证据**，不能当结论。\n- `labor_logs.earned_standard_hours` 是**加工步骤标准化工作量，非成品数量**（`字段字典.csv:169`）：跨工序可以汇总标准工时，但不能当设备台数用，也不能和成品入库量混在一条序列里。\n- 工作中心趋势按\"最近有作业日\"算，企业实物完工按自然日算（停工日为 0）——**采集缺失不能被记成停工零产出**，否则会造出假下降。\n\n检测到下降后，别从曲线直接断因，要拉设备报警（`mes_events`）、停机与报工记录交叉核查。\n\n⟦ 产量下降检测｜单位口径：台/套/件/批不能相加，已用成品入库数据量化失真（件占朴素量26.3%但仅0.8%工时、套9.3%但29.1%）｜约束：standard_hours_per_unit为模拟生成字段，折算值只作辅助证据；跨产品用标准工时产出并标注，分单位各跑7点均值+14点回归 ⟧", "id": "b00d5e36b74442fba0ecfdd8ddaf55cd", "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:53:23.337050", "finished_at": null}], "role": "assistant", "id": "d7ddec41ddae409b90a54a6f426f9283", "metadata": {"qwenpaw_turn_usage": {"usage": {"provider_id": "chinaunion", "model_name": "qwen3.8-flash", "prompt_tokens": 163447, "completion_tokens": 3391, "total_tokens": 166838, "cache_read_tokens": 148480, "cache_write_tokens": 0, "cache_eligible_input_tokens": 163447, "cache_observed": true, "cache_hit_rate": 90.84290320409674, "context_size": 1000000, "compact_threshold": 0.8, "session_cache_read_tokens": 148480, "session_cache_eligible_input_tokens": 163447, "session_cache_observed": true, "session_cache_hit_rate": 90.84290320409674}, "context_usage": {"estimated_tokens": 8105, "max_input_length": 1000000, "context_usage_ratio": 0.8104999999999999}}}, "created_at": "2026-09-17T23:52:17.494163", "usage": {"input_tokens": 163447, "output_tokens": 3391, "cache_input_tokens": 148480, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0}, "finished_at": "2026-09-17T23:53:39.159871", "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}], "reply_context": {"reply_id": "d7ddec41ddae409b90a54a6f426f9283", "cur_iter": 9, "structured_schema": null, "structured_output": null}, "permission_context": {"mode": "bypass", "working_directories": {}, "allow_rules": {}, "deny_rules": {}, "ask_rules": {}}, "tool_context": {"max_cache_files": 100, "max_cache_bytes": 25000.0, "read_file_cache": [], "activated_groups": []}, "tasks_context": {"tasks": []}, "middle_context": {"qwenpaw_auto_memory_turn_state": {"pending": ["a1888af784fa4f8cad2682f0ba3a4a87"], "seen": {"a1888af784fa4f8cad2682f0ba3a4a87": null}, "snapshots": {}, "search": {"turn_marker": "a1888af784fa4f8cad2682f0ba3a4a87", "messages": []}, "version": 2}}}, "scroll": {"persisted_ids": ["a1888af784fa4f8cad2682f0ba3a4a87", "d7ddec41ddae409b90a54a6f426f9283"], "persisted_tcids": ["call_124d3ddf33d84430b68096e4", "call_1812922f28024f6aae2e8658", "call_21c8d952eaaa490682d79e2f", "call_3ae58f4bbcdb4f9eb2522fb8", "call_5e64ea3e132e471a99a5ae93", "call_79bca18e9dc747f2b612bfa2", "call_93d8b68bf7c74b0ca4581275", "call_9ddfb28bd7f442599bcb8c1a", "call_9fda659979d74dc6bf218185", "call_dd3e3d06b43244bc92c8d4fc", "call_e202c277948543aa83c8ac9f", "call_edf3228565f7432a9afe5021", "call_fbdb1d2b17f44